WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.140
 What's up, Marvel fans?

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:02.280
We're here with Simu Liu.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.330
What is going on?

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.410
We're here at the live carpet.

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:05.460
How does it feel?

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:06.290
 It feels pretty great.

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:09.120
I'm-- I'm not sure that
these people realize

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:10.950
that I'm not in this movie.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:13.397
I think they-- you
know, I'm not going

00:00:13.397 --> 00:00:15.000
to burst their bubble for them.
- No spoilers.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.620
No spoilers.
- There are no spoilers at all.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:17.580
Anything is possible.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.500
But I'm also not in this movie.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.340
Maybe.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:24.890
 So who are you most
excited to see in this film?

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:28.065
 I'm excited to see Spider-Man.

00:00:28.065 --> 00:00:28.865
 No spoilers.

00:00:28.865 --> 00:00:33.540
 Worst ever Spider-Man
[SOUND EFFECT]??

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:34.440
Question mark?

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:36.940
I'm excited to-- no,
no, I mean, I've been--

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:39.540
I've been reading the
rumors like everybody else.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.630
I'm-- I'm so fortunate
to get to be here, to get

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:44.430
to watch this movie early.

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:47.190
And I'm just excited to
see where they take it.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.380
I-- I've been such a fan of
the-- the Spider-Man movies

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:51.030
ever since Tobey Maguire.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:54.000
I think it's just been a really
long ride and a full circle

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.110
moment for a lot of people.

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:57.065
So I'm-- I'm jazzed.

00:00:57.065 --> 00:00:57.865
I'm excited.

00:00:57.865 --> 00:01:00.090
 Well, talking about that,
previous supervillains

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:00.975
are in this movie.

00:01:00.975 --> 00:01:01.775
 Yes.

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:03.600
 What was your reaction
when you found out?

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:04.980
 I was pretty--

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:08.010
OK, well-- well, first of all,
I was like, oh my god, Doctor

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:09.300
Octopus is in the trailer.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.000
And then I was like,
oh my god, like, Jamie

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.290
Foxx was there as Electro.

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:15.780
And then it was like, oh
my god, he's got the Stark

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:17.440
tech on his-- on his armor.

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:19.320
So I was like, what
does that mean?

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:20.520
I feel like everyone
was, you know,

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:22.740
pretty blown away by-- by all
of that, I think, you know.

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.430
I-- I work for this company.

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:27.360
So I know people at Marvel,
they're master marketers.

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:29.910
They're-- you know,
they're mysterious.

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:31.410
They work in mysterious ways.

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:36.030
They operate behind a-- a
veil of secrecy and shadow.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:37.650
And-- and, you know, I'm--

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:38.580
I'm just excited.

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:40.350
I'm-- I'm excited
that I finally get

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:43.030
to take a peek behind and see
what they've been cooking up,

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:43.830
you know.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.770
I-- I feel like I--

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:49.080
I deserve to be here because
I used to play Spider-Man

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:50.980
at kid's birthday parties.

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:51.780
I dressed up.

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:55.470
I-- I inhabited the character.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:56.820
You know, I was in the costume.

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:58.830
I-- I really-- I feel
like I was Spider-Man.

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:01.640
So in a way, I do feel
like this is my premiere.

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:02.940
 Could I still hire
you for birthdays?

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:04.120
Or is it too late?

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:04.920
 You can.

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:07.150
But the rate is now
$75,000 dollars an hour.

00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:07.950
 Oh, no.

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:08.880
 Yes, it's gone
up a little bit.

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:09.840
It's-- yes.
- Spider-Man.

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:10.840
- Yeah.
- Thank you, Sima.

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:11.490
Have a good one.
Take it easy.

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:12.290
 You too.

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:14.840
[MUSIC PLAYING]

